          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano emura mumakhono kaNyasaye, nende khwikhuwa liobukoosiabwe, obunyala okhumuumbakha nibumuheelesia obulaame mubeenabo bosi abaahulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie shindayeekomba ifeetsa yomundu yesi, kata itsahaabu, kata ebiifwalo, tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe abeene mumanyile shinga olwa amakhono kano kakhalabanila obutambi bwanje, kata nende obwabeenabo aba ndalinji ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumakhuwa kosi ndamumanyia eshilolelo, shinga olwa mukhoyile okhukhoonya abahari nimukholanga emilimo muri nanwa; nimwitsulila amakhuwa kOmwami Yesu, shinga omwene olwa yaboola, mbu Okhuhaana khulimwo ikhabi, okhushila eyokhuheebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
